# Keep .git — the spec bakes the full mayhem-branch history into the image (the Dockerfile COPYs the
# checkout into /mayhem, and the grader / PATCH tier expect upstream history + the additive commit).
# Prune only build noise that would bloat the context.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
mayhem/wheelhouse/
.tox/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
